{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Star's Peaces: Memorial Edition",
    "steam_appid": 2923120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923120/extras/3f65195f9b1b410dcd9ad6e9b54df0ba.avif?t=1753992962\" width=532 height=48 /></span><br>Hikari Kamikura is a second-year high school student.<br>She has transferred to a school as many times as her age, and in April, she transferred to Heisei High School.<br>She has never had any long-lasting friends because she has transferred to a school so often, but this time, she felt something was different.<br><br>On the morning of her first day of school, she witnesses a boy who confessed his love and got rejected within a second.<br>The moment she saw this, she was shocked like never before.<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Maybe I'll make friends, if I support their love!!&quot;</i></strong><br><br>Boys and girls are at an age where they are curious about love.<br>She has an idea that if she helps everyone with their love, they will surely become her friends.<br>A simple but unprecedented plan is about to begin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923120/extras/74ff845c3cb0e077e7ec28a4017a4757.avif?t=1753992962\" width=532 height=48 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All 30 characters are main characters.<br></li><li>Collect information, persuade your classmates, and use the <strong><i>Pieces</i></strong> you obtain to support their romance.<br></li><li>There is no game over and the story structure makes it easy for anyone to play.<br></li><li>Enjoy the world of Heisei High School with its fast-paced story and direction.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923120/extras/208991953959ff4b996d5b52b2e6a3af.avif?t=1753992962\" width=532 height=48 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All graphics are now in Full HD.<br></li><li>Achievements feature implemented.<br>If you spot Takoyaki CHAN at the Heisei Festival...<br></li><li>New rewards have been added for clearing the game.<br>Unused illustrations and music in the main game will be unlocked.<br></li><li>Minor improvements have been added to the options.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923120/extras/3f65195f9b1b410dcd9ad6e9b54df0ba.avif?t=1753992962\" width=532 height=48 /></span><br>Hikari Kamikura is a second-year high school student.<br>She has transferred to a school as many times as her age, and in April, she transferred to Heisei High School.<br>She has never had any long-lasting friends because she has transferred to a school so often, but this time, she felt something was different.<br><br>On the morning of her first day of school, she witnesses a boy who confessed his love and got rejected within a second.<br>The moment she saw this, she was shocked like never before.<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Maybe I'll make friends, if I support their love!!&quot;</i></strong><br><br>Boys and girls are at an age where they are curious about love.<br>She has an idea that if she helps everyone with their love, they will surely become her friends.<br>A simple but unprecedented plan is about to begin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923120/extras/74ff845c3cb0e077e7ec28a4017a4757.avif?t=1753992962\" width=532 height=48 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All 30 characters are main characters.<br></li><li>Collect information, persuade your classmates, and use the <strong><i>Pieces</i></strong> you obtain to support their romance.<br></li><li>There is no game over and the story structure makes it easy for anyone to play.<br></li><li>Enjoy the world of Heisei High School with its fast-paced story and direction.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923120/extras/208991953959ff4b996d5b52b2e6a3af.avif?t=1753992962\" width=532 height=48 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All graphics are now in Full HD.<br></li><li>Achievements feature implemented.<br>If you spot Takoyaki CHAN at the Heisei Festival...<br></li><li>New rewards have been added for clearing the game.<br>Unused illustrations and music in the main game will be unlocked.<br></li><li>Minor improvements have been added to the options.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A manga-style visual novel game featuring 30 high school students. Hikari Kamikura races around Heisei High School in an attempt to change her friendless situation!",
